# ---- Not part of the public release (single-commit orphan push) ----
# The aim is not to hide that AI agents did much of this work (the paper and
# paper/prewriting/ai_assistance_ledger.md disclose it); it is to leave out
# credentials, agent state and private working files that a reader does not need.

# Credentials and keys
.aws/
.ssh/
